<h2 id="motion">Motion</h2>
<p>The dot is a light, so the logo can do what a light does: switch on. Five, each a class on the lockup (or <code>anim=</code> on the partial), each playing once on load — a hero, a sign-in, a loading screen, the first frame of a film. All stand down under reduced motion.</p>
