<h2>On air</h2>
<p>The ring is drawn <strong>outside</strong> the dot with a <code>box-shadow</code>, so it cannot change the lockup’s size and cannot move a letter by a pixel while it breathes. Use it on a site that is genuinely publishing something now — a live blog, a stream — and nowhere else; a light that is always on is not a light.</p>
